          "noValue": "No observation"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Inspect collection and acceptance separately\nThe bounded FBS probe records source history for diagnostic investigation. The [acquisition dashboard](/d/tradebot-acquisition) shows retrieved sessions, raw primary tick counts, empty sessions, crossed/locked quotes and checkpoint integrity.\n\nThe [Data & Quality view](/d/tradebot-data-quality) shows the published rebuild, calendar and quality evidence. Research requires an immutable eligible dataset selection with exclusions and acceptance records; raw collection totals do not establish that selection."
      },
      "targets": []
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "Research & Backtesting",
      "type": "text",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 18,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
