          "noValue": "No observation"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Evaluate an idea before risking capital\nThe [Engineering Replay](/d/tradebot-research) view shows a saved synthetic decision replay. It fits no model and contains no financial performance evaluation. This observer has no fitting producer or training control.\n\nThe reference diagnostic above shows the selected report's training flag and numerical criterion. [Data & Quality](/d/tradebot-data-quality) shows its path, date, scope and approval status. Source presence alone does not establish backtest or training readiness."
      },
      "targets": []
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
