      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Connect decisions to evidence\nThis area will explain active strategy signals, their reasons, forecasts, portfolio weights, correlations and the evidence supporting each approved strategy.\n\nThe P3 status above reflects the source inventory for features, strategies and portfolio components. `HelloStrategy` is a synthetic wiring example in the demo; it is not an approved trading strategy. No portfolio-performance evidence is inferred from the demo."
      },
      "targets": []
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "title": "Execution & Risk",
      "type": "text",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 25,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
