        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### See whether orders are permitted and why\nThis area is intended for order state, fills, positions, risk-limit usage, circuit breakers and reconciliation. The P4 status above reflects the risk, execution and broker source inventory.\n\nLive execution is observed separately from `configs/env/live.yaml`. No position, order, balance or risk-limit value is manufactured from absent trading components. Trading controls belong behind the later approved workflow and are not exposed in this read-only dashboard."
      },
      "targets": []
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "title": "Evidence & Operations",
      "type": "text",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 32,
        "w": 12,
