          "noValue": "No observation"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Know which claims are supported\nPhase statuses read the gate evidence files and match their specification hash. **Approval recorded** describes the cited gate evidence, not every current working-tree change. **In development** means source files exist; it does not claim that a phase passed acceptance.\n\nThe acquisition view separately reports checkpoint integrity, report freshness, frozen-code identity and operating-system process activity. Prometheus captures history from the time monitoring starts. The dashboard itself does not certify any gate."
      },
      "targets": []
    },
