        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Prepare for the intended account size\nThe operator confirmed USD 1,000 for the demo account and planned initial live capital. The [Broker & Trades view](/d/tradebot-broker) reports the actual observed balance and equity; this planning amount is not a live balance measurement.\n\nPaper operations follow the data, backtesting, research, risk and execution gates. P5 status reflects source inventory. Operational duration, reconciliation and performance need their own evidence before later live approval."
      },
      "targets": []
